<title>POLAND: REMAK SWINGS TO LOSS IN FEBRUARY. [CORRECTED 20:33 GMT]</title>
<headline>REMAK SWINGS TO LOSS IN FEBRUARY. [CORRECTED 20:33 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.26 vs   0.08 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.26 vs   0.09 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.31 vs   0.14 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    4.45 vs   6.34</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.76 vs   0.34 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.75 vs   0.51 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.79 vs   0.56 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    8.38 vs  12.05</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish engineering firm is Remak SA. (Corrects business of company from &quot;electromagnetic transmitter maker&quot; to &quot;engineering firm&quot;.) </p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
